<view class="container">
  <view class="page-title">我的</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">设置一个游戏昵称，让朋友认出你</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="field-label">游戏昵称</view>
    <input value="{{gameNickname}}" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：Kele#1234" bindinput="onNicknameInput" />
    <button class="primary-button save" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}">保存</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card privacy"><view>隐私说明</view><text>只保存用于房间展示的游戏昵称；不收集游戏账号或密码。</text></view>
</view>
